       the selector. A handler's `resume:` makes the failed send answer the
       value it resumes with. *)
    (* §5.5's exception. Resumable although an `Error`, so that the
       debugger can create the missing method and carry on:
       `Object>>doesNotUnderstand:` then sends the message again. A host
       receives the selector and receiver of the send nothing understood. *)
    public class MessageNotUnderstood = Error new (
        | (* The `Message` nothing understood, nil for one a program
